Package: MeMuFi
Version: 1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dmitry Orlov <cvaize@gmail.com>
Description: MeMuFi is a cross-platform GUI application for merging multiple files and directories into a single text file, optimized for use with Large Language Models (LLMs).
    The application allows you to select files and folders, apply include and exclude rules, generate a directory tree, and combine file contents into one output file.
